---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="About — Chirag Gandhi" active="about">
  <style>
    h1 { font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 2.6rem); margin-bottom: 1rem; }
    p { margin-bottom: 1rem; font-size: 1.02rem; color: #333; }
    p.lead { font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--ink); }
  </style>

  <div class="eyebrow">About</div>
  <h1>Product manager by day, builder by default.</h1>

  <p class="lead">
    I'm Chirag — a Product Manager and builder. I work at the intersection of product thinking and
    hands-on engineering: I run multi-agent pipelines, build crawlers, dashboards, and tools, and I
    care about shipping things people can actually use.
  </p>
  <p>
    My style: build small, ship publicly, iterate. This site is the standing example — every project
    here reached a state a stranger could open and try.
  </p>
  <p>
    Currently based in Luxembourg. Also learning Luxembourgish, which has spawned a few projects of
    its own.
  </p>
</Layout>
